# Business Rules

## BR-001

Every Review belongs to exactly one Review Round.

---

## BR-002

Every Feedback Item belongs to exactly one Review Round.

---

## BR-003

Deliverable Versions are associated with the active Review Round.

---

## BR-004

Round numbers are sequential and immutable.

---

## BR-005

Completed Review Rounds cannot be modified.

---

## BR-006

Minor Fix does not create a new Review Round unless configured by Workflow.

---

## BR-007

Major Fix always creates a new Review Round.

---

## BR-008

Review Round history must never be deleted.

