# Suggested Data Model

| Field | Description |
|------|-------------|
| ReviewRoundId | Primary Key |
| TaskId | Parent Task |
| RoundNumber | Sequential Number |
| Status | Active / Completed |
| Decision | Approved / Minor Fix / Major Fix |
| StartedOn | Start Date |
| CompletedOn | Completion Date |
| CreatedBy | User |
| Notes | Optional Summary |

