# Design Principles

The Review Round module follows these principles:

- Review Rounds represent production iterations.
- Every review artifact belongs to a Review Round.
- History is immutable.
- Round numbering is sequential.
- Deliverables, Feedback, Reviews and SubTasks remain fully traceable.
- Review Rounds provide complete production visibility.

